WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.820
Let me be clear. This is not a confession.

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:06.800
The Church has never recognized you

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.080
as one of the faithful.

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:10.600
Understood.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.740
But I'll hear what you have to say.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:17.300
Go ahead.

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:20.440
I am an android.

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:22.400
The Prime Minister's extension.

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:25.060
Made in the image of his youth.

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:27.620
Go to Delmore.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:31.140
You are the new Commander.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.600
I was appointed as Commander.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.020
I have taken more lives than I can remember.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.520
A ruthless weapon of war.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.780
That is the sole purpose of your existence.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.260
Commander, doesn't something feel off to you?

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:54.400
Sir, why do you have that?

00:00:54.980 --> 00:00:56.580
I really like the moon.

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.160
Every time I come out, it looks different.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:05.580
Do you believe in the afterlife?

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:06.500
No.

00:01:06.540 --> 00:01:07.500
Michael.

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.500
If something like me walked in God's path,

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.500
could my sin be forgiven?

